D                 G                       A
I'm a lead foot leaning on a souped up Chevy
D                     G                      A
I'm a good ol' boy drinkin' whiskey and rye on the levy
Bm             A               G
But she carries me when my sins make me heavy
A              D          G  A,        And loves me like Jesus does

